      "title": "Employers/Recruiters",
      "description": "Employers/Recruiters – Career Resources and Exploration | Rutgers University – Newark Skip to content Skip to AI Search Skip to main nav Log in Sign up Guests Search Keywords Make an Appointment Rutgers-Newark Handshake Request a Workshop Home About Us Staff CRE Student Employees Student Outcomes People We Connect Undergraduate Students Graduate Students Campus Partners Faculty Employers/Recruiters Family Industry Pathways Exploring/Multiple Interests Arts, Media, & Entertainment Data & Technology Financial Services, Logistics, & Management Government, Law, & Public Policy Healthcare, Pharmaceuticals, & Sciences Natural Resources, Sustainability, & Environmental Science Nonprofit, Social Justice, & Education Explore Opportunities Detecting Fraudulent Job Postings Experiential Opportunities Jobs and Internships Job Searching Making Connections Rutgers Scarlet Service Internship (RSSI) Program Professional Resources CareerThreads – Free Professional Attire Raider Headshot Studio Majors and Careers Get Career Ready Career Ready in Real Life Resumes and Cover Letters Interviewing Graduate and Professional School Personal Statements Videos on Demand Events All Events Fall 2026 Raider Career and Internship Fair at Rutgers University-Newark Raider Career Impact Awards Employers/Recruiters We welcome your interest in recruiting talent from Rutgers University-Newark, the most diverse university in the US for 20+ years and a recognized Hispanic-Serving Institution. Recruiting Rutgers-Newark talent Review our Recruiting Policies Follow this link to request your employer account on Rutgers-Newark Handshake: our platform for posting opportunities and events (including career fairs). Career Closet The Office of Career Resources and Exploration collects donations of professional attire (business casual or business professional), which are provided to students free of charge at several events throughout the academic year. If you are interested in contributing donations for the Career Closet, please contact us at careers@newark.rutgers.edu or 973-353-5311. Share Your Knowledge & Insight Support our students and answer these questions below to share your identity and industry insights with Rutgers-Newark students. Your response may be shared with our community in a blog post. Industry/Field Blog Contribution Step 1 of 2 50% Name First Last Email Organization Name Industry or Field Are you a Rutgers-Newark alum? Yes No What year did you graduate? What did you study while at Rutgers-Newark? CAPTCHA List the top 3 skills or attributes required for your industry role or field. What are the developing trends within your field? Briefly describe your role at work and key duties and how it supports the mission or goal of the organization. Is there anything else you'd like to share? Δ Identity/Affinity Blog Contribution Step 1 of 2 50% Name First Last Email Organization Name Industry or Field Are you a Rutgers-Newark alum? Yes No What year did you graduate? What did you study while at Rutgers-Newark? CAPTCHA Describe your company culture. How well does HR work toward hiring candidates of underrepresented groups? Share your greatest achievements at work. Is there anything else you'd like to share? Δ Internship Guidelines for Community Partners: Recruiters/Organizations The Office of Career Resources and Exploration uses the NACE 7 point criteria to determine if an experience is an internship.  For more information on the NACE criteria for an experience to be defined as an internship visit: https://www.naceweb.org/about-us/advocacy/position-statements/position-statement-us-internships/ . Contact us at careers@newark.rutgers.edu with any questions. Sidebar Opportunities for Community and Employer Engagement Are you an employer or recruiter looking to connect with us? We look forward to discussing best ways for your organization to be involved on campus. Please complete this form and our team will be sure to reach out! Contact Us Lates