      "description": "Healthcare, Pharmaceuticals, & Sciences – Career Resources and Exploration | Rutgers University – Newark Skip to content Skip to AI Search Skip to main nav Log in Sign up Guests Search Keywords Make an Appointment Rutgers-Newark Handshake Request a Workshop Home About Us Staff CRE Student Employees Student Outcomes People We Connect Undergraduate Students Graduate Students Campus Partners Faculty Employers/Recruiters Family Industry Pathways Exploring/Multiple Interests Arts, Media, & Entertainment Data & Technology Financial Services, Logistics, & Management Government, Law, & Public Policy Healthcare, Pharmaceuticals, & Sciences Natural Resources, Sustainability, & Environmental Science Nonprofit, Social Justice, & Education Explore Opportunities Detecting Fraudulent Job Postings Experiential Opportunities Jobs and Internships Job Searching Making Connections Rutgers Scarlet Service Internship (RSSI) Program Professional Resources CareerThreads – Free Professional Attire Raider Headshot Studio Majors and Careers Get Career Ready Career Ready in Real Life Resumes and Cover Letters Interviewing Graduate and Professional School Personal Statements Videos on Demand Events All Events Fall 2026 Raider Career and Internship Fair at Rutgers University-Newark Raider Career Impact Awards Healthcare, Pharmaceuticals, & Sciences Latest News Virtual Work Experiences Featured Employers Career Resources Vault Guides About the Community An industry is a group of organizations or companies that produce particular goods or services. There are many job roles or functions roles that exist within each industry.  Our career industry communities connect you to tailored resources and programs to effectively explore job roles/functions, cultivate professional skills, build relationships with alumni and employers, and identify and apply for opportunities in specific fields of interest. This community is dedicated to information and resources on Healthcare, Pharmaceuticals and Sciences . In these industries are careers that involve efforts made to restore the physical, mental or emotional well-being of people, the creation and preparation of medicinal drugs, and understanding the natural world using systematic methodology based on evidence. Sample Job Roles/Functions Here are some job roles/functions that are a part of Healthcare, Pharmaceuticals and Sciences industries.  As you continue to explore, you’ll find many more. Biochemist Conservationist Dentist Environmental Protection Technician Epidemiological/Medical Scientist Forensic Science Technician Geographer Nurse and Nurse Practitioner Mental Health Counselor Physical or Occupational Therapist Physician and Physician Assistant Survey Researcher Related majors at Rutgers-Newark Below you will find a list of majors at Rutgers-Newark that will provide you with academic knowledge related to this industry: Applied Physics Biology, Ecology, and Evolution Cell Biology & Neuroscience Chemistry Clinical Lab Science Computer Science Environmental Sciences Geological Sciences Geoscience Engineering Health Information Management Health Sciences Medical Imaging Sciences Medicine Molecular Biology & Biochemistry Neuroscience & Behavior Physics Plant Biology Pre-Engineering Pre-Health Pre-Pharmacy Psychiatric Rehabilitation and Psychology Psychology Social Work While recruiting timelines may vary from employer to employer, it’s helpful to know when the top recruiting times are for your industry. Take a look at the timeline below to help you learn when to prepare for your job search, and click on the timeline to learn more! Sidebar Featured Jobs & Internships Parent and Family Engagement Coach Entitled Futures Construction Safety Intern RAM Construction Services Unpaid Academic Intern, Pharmacy CalOptima - A Public Agency Health and Fitness Intern Peninsula Health Care District Health Speech Office Intern Suffolk Center for Speech and Myofunctional Therapy See All Jobs Connect with Alumni 