    "https://careers.newark.rutgers.edu/channels/resumes-and-cover-letters/": {
      "title": "Resumes and Cover Letters",
      "description": "Resumes and Cover Letters – Career Resources and Exploration | Rutgers University – Newark Skip to content Skip to AI Search Skip to main nav Log in Sign up Guests Search Keywords Make an Appointment Rutgers-Newark Handshake Request a Workshop Home About Us Staff CRE Student Employees Student Outcomes People We Connect Undergraduate Students Graduate Students Campus Partners Faculty Employers/Recruiters Family Industry Pathways Exploring/Multiple Interests Arts, Media, & Entertainment Data & Technology Financial Services, Logistics, & Management Government, Law, & Public Policy Healthcare, Pharmaceuticals, & Sciences Natural Resources, Sustainability, & Environmental Science Nonprofit, Social Justice, & Education Explore Opportunities Detecting Fraudulent Job Postings Experiential Opportunities Jobs and Internships Job Searching Making Connections Rutgers Scarlet Service Internship (RSSI) Program Professional Resources CareerThreads – Free Professional Attire Raider Headshot Studio Majors and Careers Get Career Ready Career Ready in Real Life Resumes and Cover Letters Interviewing Graduate and Professional School Personal Statements Videos on Demand Events All Events Fall 2026 Raider Career and Internship Fair at Rutgers University-Newark Raider Career Impact Awards Resumes and Cover Letters Latest News Latest News Forage Experiences Career Resources Vault Guides Videos A solid resume and cover letter are an essential part of any job search. But how do you know if your resume will stand out to employers? What does a good resume look like? The answers to these questions can vary depending on your industry and experience level, but no matter what your career level or path, you’ll want to have a strong foundation for your resume and cover letter. We’re here to help! Keep scrolling for blogs, resources, and videos to help you get started. Sample Resume Cover Letter Essentials Get On-Demand Resume Feedback Latest News How to Talk About AI Tools on Your Resume Without Sounding Like You Can’t Do the Work Yourself AI tools to master this summer to instantly boost your resume The End of Generic AI Resumes: How ATS Systems Evolved in 2026 Skilled Synonym Guide: 50+ Power Words to Upgrade Your Resume in 2026 How to Address Salary Requirements—From Cover Letter to Interview View All Career Resources Resume Outline Example Share This: Share Resume Outline Example on Facebook Share Resume Outline Example on LinkedIn Share Resume Outline Example on X Copy Link View an example resume to help build your resume for your job search. Always remember to tailor your bullet points … Read More How to Write a Resume Bullet Share This: Share How to Write a Resume Bullet on Facebook Share How to Write a Resume Bullet on LinkedIn Share How to Write a Resume Bullet on X Copy Link View Resource Curriculum Vitae (CV) Outline Share This: Share Curriculum Vitae (CV) Outline on Facebook Share Curriculum Vitae (CV) Outline on LinkedIn Share Curriculum Vitae (CV) Outline on X Copy Link View a sample outline of a curriculum vitae (CV) to help get you started on creating your own. View Resource Statement on Addresses Share This: Share Statement on Addresses on Facebook Share Statement on Addresses on LinkedIn Share Statement on Addresses on X Copy Link View Resource Thank You Letters Share This: Share Thank You Letters on Facebook Share Thank You Letters on LinkedIn Share Thank You Letters on X Copy Link View Resource STAR Method Share This: Share STAR Method on Facebook Share STAR Method on LinkedIn Share STAR Method on X Copy Link View Resource View All Resources Videos How to Fill Out Common Resume Sections Video post View All Videos Facebook Instagram X (formerly Twitter) runsa@newark.rutgers.edu CARE Team © 2026 Rutgers University - Newark  |  All Rights Reserved Universitywide New Brunswick Camden RBHS MyRutgers Blackboard ScarletMail People Search Rutgers, the State University of New Jersey, is an equal opportunity, affirmative action institution Privacy Policy | Terms of Service"
