      "title": "Fall 2026 Raider Career and Internship Fair",
      "description": "Fall 2026 Raider Career and Internship Fair at Rutgers University-Newark – Career Resources and Exploration | Rutgers University – Newark Skip to content Skip to AI Search Skip to main nav Log in Sign up Guests Search Keywords Make an Appointment Rutgers-Newark Handshake Request a Workshop Home About Us Staff CRE Student Employees Student Outcomes People We Connect Undergraduate Students Graduate Students Campus Partners Faculty Employers/Recruiters Family Industry Pathways Exploring/Multiple Interests Arts, Media, & Entertainment Data & Technology Financial Services, Logistics, & Management Government, Law, & Public Policy Healthcare, Pharmaceuticals, & Sciences Natural Resources, Sustainability, & Environmental Science Nonprofit, Social Justice, & Education Explore Opportunities Detecting Fraudulent Job Postings Experiential Opportunities Jobs and Internships Job Searching Making Connections Rutgers Scarlet Service Internship (RSSI) Program Professional Resources CareerThreads – Free Professional Attire Raider Headshot Studio Majors and Careers Get Career Ready Career Ready in Real Life Resumes and Cover Letters Interviewing Graduate and Professional School Personal Statements Videos on Demand Events All Events Fall 2026 Raider Career and Internship Fair at Rutgers University-Newark Raider Career Impact Awards Fall 2026 Raider Career and Internship Fair at Rutgers University-Newark Date: Wednesday, October 14 Time: 11am – 4pm EST Register now! Search for Organizations To open in full screen, select the icon at the bottom right. To view the Event Map where the organizations at the fair are located click here . Resumes/Cover Letters Networking Strategies Job Searching Click for more ways to prepare for the fair! Career Resources Prepare for the Fair Week Share This: Share Prepare for the Fair Week on Facebook Share Prepare for the Fair Week on LinkedIn Share Prepare for the Fair Week on X Copy Link Prepare for the Fair Prepare for the Fair Week