    "https://careers.newark.rutgers.edu/resources/the-vault-guide-to-resumes-and-job-hunting-skills-second-edition/": {
      "title": "The Vault Guide to Resumes and Job-Hunting Skills, Second Edition",
      "description": "The Vault Guide to Resumes and Job-Hunting Skills, Second Edition – Career Resources and Exploration | Rutgers University – Newark Skip to content Skip to AI Search Skip to main nav Log in Sign up Guests Search Keywords Make an Appointment Rutgers-Newark Handshake Request a Workshop Home About Us Staff CRE Student Employees Student Outcomes People We Connect Undergraduate Students Graduate Students Campus Partners Faculty Employers/Recruiters Family Industry Pathways Exploring/Multiple Interests Arts, Media, & Entertainment Data & Technology Financial Services, Logistics, & Management Government, Law, & Public Policy Healthcare, Pharmaceuticals, & Sciences Natural Resources, Sustainability, & Environmental Science Nonprofit, Social Justice, & Education Explore Opportunities Detecting Fraudulent Job Postings Experiential Opportunities Jobs and Internships Job Searching Making Connections Rutgers Scarlet Service Internship (RSSI) Program Professional Resources CareerThreads – Free Professional Attire Raider Headshot Studio Majors and Careers Get Career Ready Career Ready in Real Life Resumes and Cover Letters Interviewing Graduate and Professional School Personal Statements Videos on Demand Events All Events Fall 2026 Raider Career and Internship Fair at Rutgers University-Newark Raider Career Impact Awards The Vault Guide to Resumes and Job-Hunting Skills, Second Edition Share This: Share The Vault Guide to Resumes and Job-Hunting Skills, Second Edition on Facebook Share The Vault Guide to Resumes and Job-Hunting Skills, Second Edition on LinkedIn Share The Vault Guide to Resumes and Job-Hunting Skills, Second Edition on X Copy Link It takes more than a solid résumé and cover letter to make yourself stand out to prospective employers. Networking and your online presence can be just as important in landing an interview—and, once you get that interview, it’s up to you to sell your accomplishments and skills to convince an employer you’re the right person for the job. The Vault Guide to Résumés and Job-Hunting Skills, Second Edition provides insight and advice for all the essential elements of the job-hunting process. From organizing and perfecting your résumé to the ins and outs of submitting it to employers to preparing for an interview and answering tough questions, this guide can help you raise the bar on your job search. Coverage includes: Looking for a job: making your career plan, getting organized, tapping into your network, using information interviews Writing a résumé: choosing a résumé type, preparing and polishing a résumé step-by-step, using electronic and online résumés, using social media including LinkedIn Writing a cover letter: choosing a type of cover letter, avoiding common mistakes, deciding what to say in your cover letter Interviewing: preparing and practicing for interviews, making the right impression, answering difficult questions. The perfect guide for new professionals or those looking to advance their career, The Vault Guide to Résumés and Job-Hunting Skills, Second Edition is packed with the information you need to improve your résumé and energize your job search. Vault #9781438148465 Show author info A comprehensive resource for students and job seekers looking for career advice, job postings, company reviews from employees, and rankings of the best companies and industry employers. facebook instagram linkedin twitter View Resource Related Resources Vault Guides Show more Vault Guides Vault Guide to Health Care Provider Jobs, Second Edition Vault Career Guide to Media and Entertainment, Second Edition Vault Guide to Politics, Public Policy, and Activism Jobs, Second Edition Vault Guide to Nanotechnology Jobs, Second Edition Vault Career Guide to Education, Third Edition Vault Career Guide to Investment Banking, Second Edition Vault Guide to Nursing Jobs Vault Guide to Biology and Life Sciences Jobs, Second Edition Vault Guide to Social Services Jobs, Second Edition Vault Guide t