    "https://www.twitter.com/Vaultcareers": {
      "title": "Vault",
      "description": "Vault (@Vaultcareers) / X Log in Sign up Vault 15K posts Vault @Vaultcareers Global vault.com Joined May 2009 2,506 Following 9,663 Followers Mention Follow Posts Posts Replies Replies Reposts Reposts Media Media Log in or sign up for X See what’s happening and join the conversation Continue with phone Continue with Apple Continue with Google or Log in with username or email Terms · Privacy · Cookies · Accessibility · US TIDA · Ads Info · More © 2026 X Corp. Pinned Vault @Vaultcareers Oct 22, 2025 Our 2026 Internship Rankings are here! Find out which internship programs rank Best Overall, Most Prestigious, Best by Industry, Best by Role, Best for Inclusion, and Best for Key Employment Factors. #VaultInternshipRankings2026 vault.com Announcing Vault's 2026 Internship Rankings! Today, we're releasing our latest set of internship rankings—read on to see this year's top programs in more than 30 ranked categories. 1 247 Vault @Vaultcareers Sep 3 How does ScottMadden support new hires? We spoke with Kendall Knorr & Isabel Severino about the firm’s Fresh Start ERG - a community where employees can build relationships, learn, and grow from day one.\n\nRead more here: bit.ly/4xAoF1z 57 Vault @Vaultcareers Aug 13 KMIND Consulting just ranked #1 in Vault's 2026 Best Consulting Firms in Asia Pacific for Innovation and Overall Business Outlook. \n\nCEO Noah Xie talks AI's impact on consulting, blending Eastern + Western strategy, and more: bit.ly/4cBOp5e 1 80 Vault @Vaultcareers Jun 24 Our 2026 Banking Rankings are live! We surveyed thousands of bankers to reveal the Vault Banking 25, the 50 Most Prestigious Investment Banks, and top firms by employment factors.\n\nExplore the full results here: bit.ly/4w0NEtQ #VaultBankingRankings2026 #VaultBanking25 1 66 Vault @Vaultcareers May 12 We spoke with @ EY_Parthenon Senior Director Chantal McKay about what her typical day looks like, what made her choose EY, the types of skills she recommends to those looking to join her practice area, and more. vault.com Q&A With EY-Parthenon Senior Director Chantal McKay Vault recently spoke with Chantal McKay, a Senior Director at EY-Parthenon, about her typical day, who here clients are, what made her choose EY, and more. 1 77"
    },
